    "title": "Is Rory McIlroy married?  | Britannica",
    "text": "Ask the Chatbot Games & Quizzes History & Society Science & Tech Biographies Animals & Nature Geography & Travel Arts & Culture ProCon Money Videos You have reached Britannica's public website. Click here for ad-free access to your Britannica School or Library account. Is Rory McIlroy married? More Actions Cite Share External Websites Written and fact-checked by The Editors of Encyclopaedia Britannica Encyclopaedia Britannica's editors oversee subject areas in which they have extensive knowledge, whether from years of experience gained by working on that content or via study for an advanced degree.... The Editors of Encyclopaedia Britannica Last updated Apr. 12, 2026 Rory McIlroy is married to Erica Stoll. The two first met in 2012 at the Ryder Cup, where McIlroy was playing and Stoll was working for the PGA of America. At the time, McIlroy was dating tennis player Caroline Wozniacki; the two were briefly engaged before ending their relationship in May 2014. Later that year McIlroy began dating Stoll. They married in 2017 and had a daughter, Poppy, in 2020. Four years later Rory McIlroy filed for divorce but withdrew his petition the following month. During a subsequent interview, McIlroy said, “Thankfully, we have resolved our differences and look forward to a new beginning.” Related Questions How many majors has Rory McIlroy won? Where is Rory McIlroy from? How many F1 wins does Lewis Hamilton have? Why did Lewis Hamilton leave Mercedes? What did J.K. Rowling write? How did J.K. Rowling become famous? How did Zaha Hadid become famous? What was Zaha Hadid’s family like? Show More Feedback Corrections? Updates? Omissions? Let us know if you have suggestions to improve this article (requires login). Feedback Type Select a type (Required) Factual Correction Spelling/Grammar Correction Link Correction Additional Information Other Your Feedback Submit Feedback Thank you for your feedback Our editors will review what you’ve submitted and determine whether to revise the article. verifiedCite While every effort has been made to follow citation style rules, there may be some discrepancies. Please refer to the appropriate style manual or other sources if you have any questions. Select Citation Style MLA APA Chicago Manual of Style The Editors of Encyclopaedia Britannica. \" Is Rory McIlroy married? \". Encyclopedia Britannica, 12 Apr. 2026, https://www.britannica.com/question/Is-Rory-McIlroy-married. Accessed 16 April 2026. Copy Citation Share Share to social media Facebook X URL https://www.britannica.com/question/Is-Rory-McIlroy-married",
